{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "_comment": [
    "测试专用编译产物。",
    "apps/web 主构建是 emitDeclarationOnly（打包交给 Vite），跑不了 node --test；",
    "本机 Node 也没编译 TypeScript 支持（ERR_NO_TYPESCRIPT），不能直接跑 .ts。",
    "所以单独编一份 CJS 再交给 node --test —— 与仓库其它包一致。",
    "⚠️ 产物放 .test-out/：不能放 dist/（主构建 emptyOutDir 会清空它），也不能放 node_modules/（node --test 默认跳过该目录，会静默跑出 0 个测试）。",
    "⚠️ 只收纯逻辑测试。组件测试走 vite 那条道（见 package.json 的 test:components）——",
    "因为 react-router v8 是纯 ESM + exports map，classic 'Node' 解析根本找不到它，",
    "而 'bundler' 解析又不允许配 module:CommonJS。用打包器解决打包器的问题，别跟 tsc 硬掰。",
    "注意 exclude 必须显式写全：主 tsconfig 排除了 *.test.ts（用 node:test，与浏览器 types 冲突），",
    "继承下来会把测试文件一并排除、编出 0 个测试 —— 而 node --test 对空集返回 0（绿），是个假绿灯。",
    "⚠️ include 里那条 src/app/i18n/locales/en.json 是**跑得起来所必需**的，不是顺手加的：",
    "recorderErrorText.test.ts 断言的是「英文用户屏幕上那句话」，所以它得读产品真正的 en.json；",
    "tsc 会把 JSON 一并搬进 .test-out/unit（rootDir 相对位置不变），require 在运行期才找得到它。"
  ],
  "compilerOptions": {
    "composite": false,
    "incremental": false,
    "emitDeclarationOnly": false,
    "declaration": false,
    "declarationMap": false,
    "noEmit": false,
    "outDir": ".test-out/unit",
    "rootDir": "src",
    "tsBuildInfoFile": null,
    "jsx": "react-jsx",
    "module": "CommonJS",
    "moduleResolution": "Node",
    "verbatimModuleSyntax": false,
    "types": ["node"]
  },
  "references": [],
  "include": [
    "src/lib/stores/selectors.test.ts",
    "src/styles/tokens.contrast.test.ts",
    "src/components/app-shell/jobToastModel.test.ts",
    "src/components/app-shell/jobToastModel.ts",
    "src/lib/jobs/noteJobs.test.ts",
    "src/lib/jobs/noteJobs.ts",
    "src/lib/jobs/blockedReason.test.ts",
    "src/lib/jobs/blockedReason.ts",
    "src/lib/nav/activeNav.test.ts",
    "src/lib/nav/activeNav.ts",
    "src/features/models/asrSections.test.ts",
    "src/features/models/asrSections.ts",
    "src/features/models/engineFit.test.ts",
    "src/features/models/engineFit.ts",
    "src/features/models/engineReasonText.test.ts",
    "src/components/common/engineReasonText.ts",
    "src/features/runtime/packAxes.test.ts",
    "src/features/runtime/packAvailability.test.ts",
    "src/features/runtime/packStatus.ts",
    "src/lib/safe.ts",
    "src/lib/wording.ts",
    "src/lib/remediation/routes.test.ts",
    "src/lib/remediation/routes.ts",
    "src/lib/api/notesCache.test.ts",
    "src/lib/api/notesCache.ts",
    "src/features/notes/noteAssets.test.ts",
    "src/features/notes/noteAssets.ts",
    "src/features/notes/seekParam.test.ts",
    "src/features/notes/seekParam.ts",
    "src/features/search/searchModes.test.ts",
    "src/features/search/modes.ts",
    "src/features/mindmap/docSignature.test.ts",
    "src/features/mindmap/docSignature.ts",
    "src/lib/format/jobName.test.ts",
    "src/lib/format/jobName.ts",
    "src/lib/format/localized.ts",
    "src/lib/format/peaks.test.ts",
    "src/lib/format/peaks.ts",
    "src/features/capture/upload.test.ts",
    "src/features/capture/upload.ts",
    "src/lib/api/client.test.ts",
    "src/lib/api/queryAndSurface.test.ts",
    "src/lib/events/sseNaming.test.ts",
    "src/lib/format/singleSource.test.ts",
    "src/lib/api/client.ts",
    "src/lib/api/connect.ts",
    "src/lib/stores/progress.store.ts",
    "src/lib/api/surfaces.ts",
    "src/lib/utils.ts",
    "src/lib/format/time.ts",
    "src/lib/api/types.ts",
    "src/lib/events/types.ts",
    "src/features/diagnostics/checkText.test.ts",
    "src/features/diagnostics/checkText.ts",
    "src/features/components/sha256ProvenanceRegex.test.ts",
    "src/features/recorder/recorderErrorText.test.ts",
    "src/features/recorder/recorderErrorText.ts",
    "src/app/i18n/locales/en.json"
  ],
  "exclude": []
}
